    cuda_gpu_gated_spec_defects_2026-08-09, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "At pinned base gpu.rs:1382 rt_cuda_device_compute_capability_fn still returns -3 unconditionally in non-cuda builds. PTX and LaunchConfig fixes do not implement the missing dlopen query or all original audio build/deploy/readback requirements.", "test/03_system/feature/usage/gpu_ptx_gen_spec.spl; test/03_system/io_audio/simple_audio_cuda_q15_env_spec.spl; test/01_unit/lib/gc_async_mut/engine/audio/simple_audio_cuda_q15_packed_bounds_spec.spl; source inspected only", "Implement optional cuDeviceGetAttribute dlopen query with propagated failures; audit all named CUDA fallback shims and audio build/deploy/readback; run real gated specs with pinned rebuilt producer and CUDA device."
    gui_web_2d_retained_metal_simd_wm_perf_evidence_gap_2026-07-06, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "check-wm-production-fullscreen-evidence.shs retained-receipt validator exists. Bug doc Sep22 explicitly limits it to schema admission and records no fresh live Metal CPU SIMD or SimpleOS WM performance receipts.", "test/03_system/check/gui_retained_perf_source_freshness_spec.spl; test/03_system/check/wm_production_fullscreen_evidence_spec.spl; source inspected only", "Produce source/executable-bound retained hosted WM Metal and CPU SIMD plus SimpleOS/QEMU receipts with captures checksum p50/p95 RSS fallback and comparable baselines; validate each without treating schema fixtures as frame performance."
    module_load_24s_unless_window_winit_imported_2026-07-25, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "Nov5 bug evidence records scripts/tool/spirv-to-spl-words.shs plus seven generated-module bare-word fixes and five pinned-SPIRV guards. Historical35.1s-to12s remains slower than winit0.9-1.3s; source_uses_jit_unsafe_graphics_runtime substring lane selection remains a documented independent residual. Exact original implementation commit is unavailable beyond pinned base source; no new performance proof.", "scripts/check/check-blit-spirv-pinned.shs; check-blur-rect-spirv-pinned.shs; check-glass-material-spirv-pinned.shs; check-rect-batch-spirv-pinned.shs; check-shadow-rect-spirv-pinned.shs; source inspected only", "Replace comment-substring lane selection using typed dependency ownership and profile admitted-runtime import closures; distinguish necessary JIT compile cost from policy/invalidation defects before changing source."
    sfnt_fvar_option_match_nil_baremetal_2026-08-04, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "src/lib/common/encoding/sfnt.spl parse_fvar_axes:85 onward retains the Option-free scalar workaround. Original Some/None value-position Option<OtTable> extraction is not restored or qualified by the parsing specs. Later generic enum fixes do not independently prove this guest path.", "test/01_unit/lib/common/encoding/sfnt_spec.spl; sfnt_static_axes_font_admission_spec.spl; scripts/check/check-simpleos-wm-fullscreen-evidence.shs; source inspected only", "Reproduce original value-position OtTable extraction with rebuilt freestanding producer; repair typed enum discriminant/payload owner from real evidence and run original OVMF path before removing workaround."
    vulkan_web_fullpage_cpu_fallback_demotion_2026-08-10, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "backend_vulkan_helpers.spl _dispatch_framebuffer_checked:1623 preserves bounded retry and rejects degenerate arguments; backend_vulkan.spl readback:2496 onward preserves completion_unknown fail-closed and explicit cpu_fallback provenance. Bug Aug11 records retry success but residual command-buffer creation failure under tall-page memory pressure; current original800x2600 device receipt missing.", "test/02_integration/rendering/vulkan_engine2d_batch_fallback_live_spec.spl; source inspected only", "Run actual800x2600 retained page with pinned admitted producer and first-failing Vulkan SFFI trace plus bounded memory measurements; fix command-buffer lifecycle/resource cause without weakening completion or provenance gates."
    layout_gpu_semantic_device_boundary_2026-07-31, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "Bug document declares bounded block/flex/grid absolute/overflow/Latin slices implemented but explicitly leaves full WPT parity and shaped complex-script line breaking open. Current recorded layout_paint.spl is only opacity helper; actual semantic consumer is gpu_web.layout CudaLayoutExecutionPort and web_layout_run_full imported by live integration spec. Do not treat recorded-file presence as whole layout completion.", "test/02_integration/rendering/web_layout_cuda_live_spec.spl; current imports name semantic upload dispatch readback boundary; source inspected only", "Run WPT-derived production parity corpus; enumerate uncovered semantics and implement admitted slices with pre-dispatch refusals; specify shaped complex-script contract before device line-break support."
    return_type_result_mismatch_class_audit_2026-08-08, /root/p2_22, fixing, partial, "Bug Nov5 appendix reports zero true src/lib+src/app residuals and config_loader.spl:22/:313 return Result<DLConfig,text>; it explicitly preserves roughly22-site src/compiler refactor-damage remainder owned elsewhere. Recorded validation.spl is a false positive. Whole original family is not proved implemented, so library green cannot close full row.", "test/01_unit/lib/gc_async_mut/dl/config_loader_spec.spl; historical doc records1executed1passed with phase1_1793422538 on aarch64; not rerun or promoted to current PASS", "Reconcile explicit compiler-family ownership and audit each remaining typed return path at pinned current source; retain library false-positive classifications without erasing original compiler scope."
    web_render_backend_api_spec_perf_2026-06-05, /root/p2_22, fixing, unknown, "Original report times11tests at71354ms. Current test/01_unit/app/ui/web_render_backend_api_spec.spl has expanded adapter imports and retained-cache cases; WebRenderPixelArtifactCache exists at web_render_pixel_backend.spl:144. No source change or current measured hotspot ties that cache to complete spec startup/latency repair.", "test/01_unit/app/ui/web_render_backend_api_spec.spl sample_state and retained static/dynamic cache scenarios; source inspected only", "Profile current admitted runtime cold and warm full-spec phases; optimize measured setup/import/render owner while preserving assertions and dynamic-cache invalidation; do not split files merely to evade per-file threshold."
